  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Making Water Count Incubator</narrative>
  </title>
  <description akvo:type="4" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovate - Drinking water / Sanitation</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="8" type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To incubate around 10 entrepreneurs in improving their WASH business</narrative>
  </description>
  <description akvo:type="5" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WSIP is a Water and Sanitation Incubation Programme, the first of its kind in Ethiopia. It is done by Ice Addis, that was contracted by Aqua for All. It is meant to give a boost to several WASH enterprises, most of them having a rather marginal existence in the public sector and NGO dominated WASH scene.</narrative>
  </description>
